docs {
  # Update User Preference
  
  Updates an existing user preference.
  
  ## URL Parameters
  
  | Parameter | Type | Required | Description |
  |-----------|------|----------|-------------|
  | `id` | UUID | **Required** | Preference ID |
  
  ## Request Body
  
  | Field | Type | Required | Description |
  |-------|------|----------|-------------|
  | `categoryCode` | string | Optional | Category code |
  | `channel` | string | Optional | Channel code |
  | `isEnabled` | boolean | Optional | Enable/disable notifications |
}
